hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2943","Narrated to us Yunus ibn 'Abd al-A'la, narrated to us Ibn Wahb, narrated to me Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of 'Ata', on the authority of Ibn 'Abbas (RA) that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did not perform *ramal* (brisk walking) in the seven circuits during which he performed *ifadah* (the Farewell Tawaf).

'Ata' (RA) said: No *ramal* was performed in it.

**CHAPTER:**"
